    ('Weathered paint with mold spots', 'Find painted areas with dark spots or patches of mold or mildew growth, especially in shadowy or damp areas of the door.', 'Show painted door surface with dark mold or mildew spots, patches, or discoloration visible on the finish.', 'uncommon'::public.item_rarity, 'Mold on exterior paint indicates paint permeability failure; quality paint should breathe moisture out faster than mold spores colonize.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/417ca3a20bce2486.jpg', 15),
